@nsobid-6830B3A12406CB4716FEC5ADDC35D3E2DC92D212

# Splatoon 3 11.2.0 - Level of Detail

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Forces the texture sampler mip-LOD bias to -1.0 for sharper textures.
// Splatoon 3 builds NVN samplers through TWO independent paths, so both are
// patched -- patching only one leaves half the game's textures at stock LOD:
//
//   * nn::gfx::detail::SamplerImpl<NvnApi>::Initialize (sub_7100A7D85C) --
//     loads SamplerInfo.lodBias from +0x10 just before
//     nvnSamplerBuilderSetLodBias.
//   * agl's own sampler builder (sub_71045A4830), which drives
//     nvnSamplerBuilder directly and loads its bias from +0x18.
//
// Both LDR S0,[Xn,#imm] are replaced with FMOV S0, #-1.0. This rewrites the
// SOURCE of the bias, so it applies to every sampler the title creates.

@enabled
00A7D960 00103E1E   // FMOV S0,#-1.0   (was LDR S0,[X20,#0x10] -- nn::gfx SamplerImpl::Initialize)
045A48E0 00103E1E   // FMOV S0,#-1.0   (was LDR S0,[X20,#0x18] -- agl sampler builder)
@stop

// Offsets reverse-engineered against Splatoon 3's sead + Cmn/spl::gfx + agl/gsys
// engine. 11.2.0 retail is symbol-stripped -- every site above was located by
// structure and byte-verified against the IDB before being written.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
